      {
        "id": "p47-q73-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Show that $s_1=a_1$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$s_1=a_1$.\n\nUse the cubic sum-of-roots relationship.",
          "worked": "By the cubic sum-of-roots relationship,\n$$\\begin{align*}s_1&=\\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma\\\\s_1&=-(-a_1)=a_1.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p47-q73-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Show that $s_2=a_1s_1-2a_2$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$s_2=a_1s_1-2a_2$.\n\nExpand the square of the sum of the roots and subtract twice the sum of pairs.",
          "worked": "The root-coefficient relationships give $\\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma=a_1$ and $\\alpha\\beta+\\alpha\\gamma+\\beta\\gamma=a_2$. Expanding the square of the root sum,\n$$\\begin{align*}s_2&=(\\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma)^2-2(\\alpha\\beta+\\alpha\\gamma+\\beta\\gamma)\\\\s_2&=a_1^2-2a_2\\\\s_2&=a_1s_1-2a_2.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p47-q73-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Show that $s_3=a_1s_2-a_2s_1+3a_3$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$s_3=a_1s_2-a_2s_1+3a_3$.\n\nSubstitute each root into the cubic and add the three equations.",
          "worked": "Each root satisfies $P(x)=0$, so\n$$\\begin{align*}\\alpha^3-a_1\\alpha^2+a_2\\alpha-a_3&=0\\\\\\beta^3-a_1\\beta^2+a_2\\beta-a_3&=0\\\\\\gamma^3-a_1\\gamma^2+a_2\\gamma-a_3&=0.\\end{align*}$$\nAdding the three equations gives $s_3-a_1s_2+a_2s_1-3a_3=0$. Hence,\n$$\\begin{align*}s_3&=a_1s_2-a_2s_1+3a_3.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      },
      {
        "id": "p47-q73-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": {
          "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
          "version": 1,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "p47-q73-d-intro",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "fontSize": null,
              "align": "left",
              "spaceBefore": 0,
              "spaceAfter": 2,
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "indent": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "For the quartic polynomial",
